message: "If you use MultiClaude in your work, please cite it as below."
title: MultiClaude
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Quentin
    family-names: Caron
abstract: >-
  A free, open source macOS menu bar app that runs several Claude desktop
  accounts side by side, one profile (one --user-data-dir folder) per account,
  with a Go command line tool, multiclaude. Not affiliated with Anthropic.
version: "1.11"
date-released: 2026-11-18
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: https://github.com/QuentinCar0n/multiclaude
url: https://quentincar0n.github.io/multiclaude/
keywords:
  - claude
  - macos
  - menu-bar-app
  - multiple-accounts
  - claude-code
